    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub></msup></math> are in geometric progression,&nbsp;then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
